fault":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":649800701,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw2NDk4MDA3MDE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:network","name":"topic:network","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":7,"created_at":"2026-06-21T16:15:18Z","updated_at":"2026-09-21T15:31:15Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.7.stable.official [5b4e0cb0f]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9227) - AMD Ryzen 5 5600H with Radeon Graphics (12 threads) - 31.34 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen passing the port parameter to `UDPServer.listen()` or `TCPServer.listen()` that's out of the range from 0 to 65535 (u16), it wraps to be in it, because the c++ function takes in a `uint16_t`.\n\nLook at this code for example:\n```gdscript\nvar s := TCPServer.new()\ns.listen(-5, \"*\")\nprint(s.get_local_port())\n```\nprints \"65531\", and `s.listen()` doesn't return any error.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen the MRP, run the main scene, follow the console output.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29179998/mrp.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120521/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120521/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}